<title>UK: BOE allots 985 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 985 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 985 million stg of assistance.</p>
<p>It allotted 79 million stg in bills outright and 906 million stg in 6.0 percent repos to May 15 and 16.</p>
<p>The Bank's initial liquidity shortage was 1.8 billion stg.</p>
</text>
